  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "做伙來唸詩 - 若是到淡水"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "\n<div class=\"tg-article\" style=\"font-family: 'Microsoft JhengHei', sans-serif; max-width: 800px; margin: 0 auto; line-height: 1.8; color: #333;\">\n    <h1 style=\"color: #000; font-size: 36px; text-align: center; margin-bottom: 5px; font-weight: bold;\">若是到淡水</h1>\n    \n    \n    \n    <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 30px;\">\n        <p style=\"color: #555; font-size: 20px; margin: 0;\">/ 張雲淞</p>\n        \n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tg-images\">\n        <div style=\"text-align: center; margin-bottom: 20px;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEhwckmt1lJ2ja_K9EkBdWCw2fzoE04bydVh6LOclBQxnI85JB9oP6pEz1jzxBNh_H_ob6qt5AnlNlQ_463PqifW3bdwhj7T24u6bMR9BXRI1GFPEE0xfn77dfQaDyk8ndT_w2KPsIpFXlxW4FDSWJKWgYNoggpGefIDmP_4dys9od0O2Cg2vf5I9aNghEeg\" style=\"max-width: 100%; height: auto; border-radius: 4px;\"></div>\n    </div>\n    \n    <div class=\"tg-content\" style=\"font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 0.5px; margin-bottom: 30px; text-align: justify; padding: 0 10px;\">\n        若是到淡水<br>Tio̍h-ài春天ê時tsūn<br>淡水河ê微風<br>輕輕仔吹<br>河岸邊<br>白翎鷥thián翼<br>水湧拍岸邊<br><br>若是到淡水<br>Tio̍h-ài熱--人ê時tsūn<br>紅毛城ê厝頂<br>Hònn客款待夕陽<br>舊街ê鼓仔燈<br>照tī販仔面頂ê笑容<br><br>若是到淡水<br>Tio̍h-ài寒--人ê時tsūn<br>漁人碼頭ê船隻<br>流連tī海波浪<br>來一甌lâ-lûn仔燒ê豆花<br>溫暖你ê心情<br><br>若是到淡水<br>M̄免揀時tsūn<br>媽祖ê保庇<br>護佑港口ê安寧<br>Tsit phiàn闊bóng-bóng ê大海永遠是阮ê故鄉<br>\n    </div>\n\n    \n\n    <div class=\"donation-section\" style=\"background-color: #fcfcfc; border: 1px solid #eeeeee; border-radius: 10px; overflow: hidden; margin-top: 40px;\">\n        <div style=\"width: 100%;\"><img src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEjrKYoXj_wJUTBPNsu8d3MYYKNtLRX5xKPGaZn5mDxlhszDdwK5pfUju_FzwHQyamnz6XfIfoltdTkXQxs0L0IB-lOe4XUsmJ_gEfjJp1DMrMlC0ipugio_S0ObqohWlgLov0Bc07xLvv1qnED4d0IdAxEEgIsBXmUKlKQuB7DFec3bMDJhXZQkORLsl94N\" style=\"width: 100%; display: block;\"></div>\n        <div style=\"padding: 30px; text-align: center; font-family: 'Times New Roman', serif;\">\n            <div style=\"margin-bottom: 15px; font-size: 22px;\">\n                <b><span style=\"color: #3778cd;\">#台文通訊BONG報</span> 382期，2026年01月出刊。</b>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 18px; margin-bottom: 10px;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會</div>\n            <div style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: 16px;\">\n                線上捐款(定期定額) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a><br>\n                線上捐款(單筆) <a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" style=\"color: #3778cd; text-decoration: none;\" target=\"_blank\">點此連結</a>\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 15px; line-height: 1.5;\">\n                郵政劃撥：19021486 / 戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會<br>\n                電匯：123-20-050514-2 (華南銀行士林分行)\n            </div>\n            <div style=\"color: #050505; font-size: 15px; margin-top: 25px; padding-top: 15px; border-top: 1px solid #eee; text-align: justify;\">\n                #李江却台語文教基金會 需要你ê定期捐款，逐年贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$2,400，lán做伙復振台灣語文ê事工kap雜誌編印發行費用，捐款thang抵稅。\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</div>"
  },
